  "body": "** CONJUNCTIONAL AGENTS WELCOME! BRING YOUR BUYERS! **\r\n\r\nWhy build when your coastal masterpiece is ready right now?\r\n\r\nWelcome to 15 Anehana, a pristine, brand-new G.J. Gardner home perfectly positioned in a highly sought-after enclave. Designed to capture all-day northern sunshine and breathtaking sea views, this is luxury coastal living elevated to the next level.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU’LL FALL IN LOVE:\r\n\r\n• Sun-Drenched Living: Full-width northern orientation bathes the main living areas in natural light, optimizing maximum warmth and effortless energy efficiency year-round.\r\n\r\n• Breathtaking Gulf Vistas: Enjoy beautiful coastal views straight from your living room and a seamless alfresco deck.\r\n\r\n• 4 Spacious Bedrooms: Generously proportioned sanctuaries designed for absolute comfort.\r\n\r\n• Chef-Style Kitchen: High-end finishes featuring a full walk-in scullery and smooth indoor-outdoor flow made for effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\n• Dual Living Spaces: Two distinct living areas give growing families the space to relax, spread out, and connect.\r\n\r\n• Total Peace of Mind: Backed by a trusted 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nLOCATION PERFECTION: Moments from golden beaches, vibrant local cafes, boutique shopping, and top-tier schooling. Premium coastal lifestyle without the wait.\r\n\r\nDON'T JUST IMAGINE THE VIEW, COME EXPERIENCE IT.\r\n\r\n Albany | Long Bay | Torbay | Browns Bay | Mairangi Bay | Takapuna | Milford | Greenhithe | Schnapper Rock | Millwater | Milldale | Red Beach | Orewa | Silverdale | Whangaparaoa | Stanmore Bay | Gulf Harbour | Manly | Army Bay | Hibiscus Coast | North Shore relocation | Auckland real estate | Coastal lifestyle | Brand new build | Sea views | Hauraki Gulf views | Ocean views | Freehold | GJ Gardner home | Executive family living | Move-in ready | Lock and leave | Master Build Guarantee | Luxury home NZ | Conjunctional welcome\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
